      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would binman symbols help here? It allows a symbol value (e.g. the size of a section) to be written to an variable in the binary:\n\nhttps://u-boot.readthedocs.io/en/latest/develop/package/binman.html#access-to-binman-entry-offsets-at-run-time-symbols\n\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/u-boot/+/refs/heads/chromeos-v2023.10-next/include/binman_sym.h\n\nBut it seems you are already handling this in the link script, which is fine",
