      "writtenOn": "2023-11-06T21:46:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did a bit experiment on this path. Binman puts these symbols in the section(\".binman_sym\") and fills them later. But `current_image_data` is in another section(\".fixed.ver\") and its `.size` needs to be modified. Probably need more effort to support this use case.\n\n```\nconst struct image_data __keep current_image_data FIXED_SECTION(\"ver\") \u003d { \n        .cookie1 \u003d CROS_EC_IMAGE_DATA_COOKIE1, \n        .version \u003d CROS_EC_VERSION32, \n#ifndef TEST_BUILD\n        .size \u003d (const uintptr_t)\u0026__image_size,\n#endif  \n        .rollback_version \u003d CONFIG_ROLLBACK_VERSION, \n        .cookie2 \u003d CROS_EC_IMAGE_DATA_COOKIE2, \n        .cros_fwid \u003d CROS_FWID32, \n        .cookie3 \u003d CROS_EC_IMAGE_DATA_COOKIE3, \n};\n```",
      "parentUuid": "233f739e_f920f692",
      "revId": "a98546be97c90593c4cd32568d94f66a54e88094",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
